    "description": "<p>The Solar's hands become weapons of focused Essence, capable of shattering any material as if it were glass. The Solar makes a (Strength + Craft) roll against a difficulty equal to the target object's Damage rating. Success shatters the object into useless fragments. If the Solar has a higher Strength than the minimum Strength required to wield an object, the object's Damage rating is reduced by the difference for purposes of this Charm. Living beings are immune to this Charm's effects.</p>",
